  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Über unsere Marke und Produkte</strong></h3><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Selig Markenoutlet steht für exklusives<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>High-End Make-up</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>und hochwertige Beauty-Produkte zu<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>stark reduzierten Preisen</strong>.<br>Unsere Kundinnen und Kunden erhalten<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>100 % Originalprodukte</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>bekannter Premiummarken – oft als<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>limitierte Angebote</strong>.<br>Ein besonderes Highlight sind<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>unsere Live-Events</strong>, bei denen wir die besten Deals präsentieren.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Was uns besonders macht</strong></h3><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p><strong>High-End Make-up zu Outlet-Preisen</strong></p></li><li><p>Ausschließlich<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Originalprodukte</strong></p></li><li><p><strong>Seli’s geile Deals</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-spa