e;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Social Media (Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, YouTube)</p></li><li><p>Hinweise &amp; Verlinkungen zu<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Seli’s Live-Events</strong></p></li><li><p>Produktvorstellungen, Tutorials &amp; Live-Reviews</p></li><li><p>Deal- &amp; Rabattplattformen</p></li><li><p>Story-Links, Reels und Kurzvideos</p></li></ul><p style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\">Wir stellen bei Bedarf<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Marketingmaterial, Texte und exklusive Angebote</strong><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span>zur Verfügung.</p><hr style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;\"><h3 style=\"font-style:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><strong>Weitere Informationen</strong></h3><ul style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;color:rgb(0,0,0);\"><li><p>Zielgruppe: Make-up- &amp; Beauty-Fans, Schnäppchenjäger</p></li><li><p>Regelmäßige<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\"> </span><strong>Live-Events mit exklusiven Angeboten</strong></p></li><li><p>Schneller Versand &amp; zuverlässiger Kundenservice</p></li><li><p>Enge &amp; langfristige Zusammenarbeit mit Affiliates</p></li></ul></div></div>",
